      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "In Utah, a professional roof inspection costs between $100 and $400 for a standard residential home, with most homeowners paying an average of $230.85 per visit. However, prices fluctuate based on the specific method of inspection used, the complexity of your roof, and your goals (such as buying a home or securing insurance) .",
        "snippet_highlighted_words": [
          "between $100 and $400"
        ]
      },
